      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.1176147460938,
        512.4198608398438,
        531.1176147460938
      ],
      "text": "Contraindications include: active hepatitis (acute or chronic) and symptoms of peripheral neuropathy. Past history of TB  c",
